{"url": "https://science.indianapolis.iu.edu/psychology/admissions/index.html", "final_url": "https://science.indianapolis.iu.edu/psychology/admissions/index.html", "status": 200, "method": "http", "fetched": "2026-11-13", "text": "Admissions: Psychology: Indiana University Indianapolis\nSkip to Content\nSkip to Main Navigation\nSkip to Search\nIndiana University Indianapolis\nIndiana University Indianapolis\nIU Indianapolis\nMenu\nAbout\nFacts & Statistics\nNews\nEvents\nContact\nAdmissions\nApply\nFinancial Aid & Scholarships\nScholarships\nAcademics\nDegrees & Programs\nMinors\nCourses\nCapstone Courses\nAcademic Support\nResearch\nStudent Opportunities\nFaculty Labs\nCenters & Partners\nWorkBetter IU\nHonors & Awards\nK\u201312 Outreach Programs\nAlumni & Giving\nPeople\nSchool of Science\nPsychology\nHome\nAbout\nFacts & Statistics\nNews\nEvents\nContact\nAdmissions\nApply\nFinancial Aid & Scholarships\nAcademics\nDegrees & Programs\nCourses\nCapstone Courses\nAcademic Support\nResearch\nStudent Opportunities\nFaculty Labs\nCenters & Partners\nHonors & Awards\nK\u201312 Outreach Programs\nAlumni & Giving\nPeople\nHome\nAdmissions\nAdmissions\nBegin your journey as a psychology student\nAre you ready to join a community of students and faculty who are passionate about the science behind behavioral, mental, and social processes?\nAs a student, you\u2019ll benefit from small classes with highly accomplished faculty in addiction neuroscience, applied social and organizational psychology, clinical psychology, and industrial/organizational psychology. You'll also have unique interdisciplinary experiences that allow you to collaborate across the academic and business communities.\nWhether you are looking to pursue an undergraduate degree or apply for one of our highly competitive graduate programs, we\u2019re excited to learn about your goals, and what you can bring to our engaging and research-driven community.\nLearn how to apply\nExplore our programs and degrees\nInvest in your future\nAn education here is a great value. We work hard to keep the cost of attendance low\u2014and even harder to make sure your tuition dollars go as far as possible.\nMore than 85 percent of IU Indianapolis undergraduate students receive financial aid. In fact, IU Indianapolis awards more than $231 million in scholarships each year.\nFind out about financial aid\nSchedule a visit\nIU Indianapolis and the School of Science have both on-campus and virtual visit options available.\nLearn how to schedule a visit\nWe welcome your questions\nUndergraduate admissions\nConnect with an admissions counselor \u00bb\nGraduate admissions\nPsychology graduate program assistance\nFor application and admissions questions, please contact us by email!\ngradpsy@iu.edu\nApply\nFinancial Aid & Scholarships", "links": [["Skip to Content", "https://science.indianapolis.iu.edu/psychology/admissions/index.html#content"], ["Skip to Main Navigation", "https://science.indianapolis.iu.edu/psychology/admissions/index.html#local-nav"], ["Skip to Search", "https://science.indianapolis.iu.edu/psychology/admissions/index.html#_search"], ["Indiana University Indianapolis Indiana University Indianapolis IU Indianapolis", "https://indianapolis.iu.edu/index.html"], ["", "https://science.indianapolis.iu.edu/psychology/search"], ["About", "https://science.indianapolis.iu.edu/psychology/about/index.html"], ["Facts & Statistics", "https://science.indianapolis.iu.edu/psychology/about/facts-stats.html"], ["News", "https://science.indianapolis.iu.edu/psychology/about/news/index.html"], ["Events", "https://science.indianapolis.iu.edu/psychology/about/events.html"], ["Contact", "https://science.indianapolis.iu.edu/psychology/about/contact/index.html"], ["Admissions", "https://science.indianapolis.iu.edu/psychology/admissions/index.html"], ["Apply", "https://science.indianapolis.iu.edu/psychology/admissions/apply.html"], ["Financial Aid & Scholarships", "https://science.indianapolis.iu.edu/psych